  "label": "The concept of zombies as non-human entities in popular culture",
  "description": "In popular culture, zombies are often depicted as non-human entities, lacking the moral and legal status of human beings. In the meme, the concept of zombies as non-human entities is used to imply that their killing cannot be classified as homicide, thereby justifying or minimizing racially motivated violence. This requires understanding of the concept of zombies as non-human entities in popular culture and its implications.",
